# <%~ it.instance.name || it.instance.slug %>: Offer Pack
<%
  /* v3 (#184): the offer as the candidate receives it, sent when the offer is extended and before
     any contract. Kept from v2 but trimmed to what the candidate needs to decide; the Appointment
     Confirmation follows once the contract is signed and payroll validates.
     `document-control: false` (no Document Control or Review and sign-off tables) and
     `satisfies-gate: false` (rendered at onboarding-approved but never counts toward it), so
     `requires` is exactly what this prints plus the filename token.

     Never add the offer status or negotiation (the organisation's record of the offer), contract,
     payroll, selection or vetting content, or open questions here. `offer.terms` states the band
     and position in band, never the figure: HR adds the figure to the copy they send, outside the
     repository. The term shows only when filled: an internal "— not stated —" marker never goes
     to a candidate. */
%>
